Breaking Good/Bad News
\par
So far our discussion has studied two-stage lotteries whose method of
\par
resolution is determined before the resolution takes place. The opposite
\par
order is possible if someone other than the decision maker already knows
\par
the outcome and can select the method of resolution in the decision
\par
