\par
the disaster (p. \textbf{66). }They argued that the \textbf{1961 }financial statements - the last
\par
published before the group collapsed - did not present a `true and fair view',
\par
despite the auditor's assertions to the contrary (p. \textbf{\emph{80).}}
\par
In the same month, an editorial commented that auditors had played an
\par
`ineffectual role . , . in recent events' (AFR, 9 December \textbf{1963).}
