action was permissible. In addition, stocks and work-in-progress were said to have
\par
been overstated by \textbf{\$3.5 }million at 30 June \textbf{1968, }but the directors in writing down
\par
this item had increased fixed assets by the same amount. The auditors stated that
\par
they were unable `to determine the extent of this expenditure which may properly
\par
