\par
ceased in \textbf{1963; \emph{Technical Bulletins }}in \textbf{1965. }As previously noted these publications dealt
\par
with procedural matters (such as, `Time Recording, Costing and Charging Procedures in an
\par
Accounting Office', or `Cost Control in the Road Transport Industry'), or with extensions
\par
of existing standards (such as, `Accounting for Unearned Income in Instalment Transactions').
