\par
the unlawful employment practice and \emph{establishing }or \emph{author-}
\par
\emph{izing }a state or local authority to grant or seek relief from
\par
such practice or to institute criminal proceedings with respect
\par
thereto . . \textbf{\emph{,,}}
\par
This language applied to three types of state statutes. First
\par
