\par
dysfunctional behaviour. Or, in the opposite extreme, this senior-dominated decision-
\par
making could follow the pattern described by Dye's `elite theory' \textbf{(1975), }where right-
\par
thinking but insulated power elitists screen out discordant information in their efforts to
