Whether this decision will stem the slight turn in the tide against the
\par
poison pill gambit, or whether its very uncertainty will hasten the turn,
\par
obviously cannot yet be predicted. At the least, however, the fiduciary
\par
overtones of this review of enabling provisions that may be interpreted to
\par
