\par
developments should sensitize federal courts to the legitimacy of substan-
\par
tive and macroeconomic concerns about the interests of both sides in
\par
these merger wars. State law involvement in the control of tender offers
\par
is outside the scope of this Article, but I would hope that a clearer under-
\par
standing of the subjects reviewed here might benefit the ongoing discus-
\par
sion of those issues as well.
