\par
pinning of the entire efficiency-monitoring concept. The economic
\par
rationale, however, assumes that the market for voice is separate from
\par
the market for exit through a stock exchange or other share market. It is
\par
a necessary condition of the economic rationale that these two markets
\par
be separable because each provides an independent monitoring system. \textbf{109}
