\par
to be passive. He simply sells his shares if he is dissatisfied \textbf{...}
\par
Tender offers are a method of monitoring the work of management teams \textbf{...}
\par
When the difference between the market price of a firm's share and the price those shares
\par
might have under different circumstances becomes too great, an outsider can profit by
\par
