\textbf{163 }\emph{See }Easterbrook \& Fischel, \emph{Auctions and Sunk Costs in Tender Offers, }35 \textbf{STAN. }L. REv. 1
\par
(1982) [hereinafter cited as Easterbrook \& Fischel, \emph{Auctions]; }Easterbrook \& Fischel, \emph{supra }note 109.
