\textbf{\emph{C. }}\emph{The Elimination of the Voting Right of Common Stock}
\par
Nonvoting common stock is another device that requires an assess-
\par
ment of the role of shareholder participation. Nonvoting common stock
\par
is not a new phenomenon. As early as \textbf{1917 }a New Jersey Chancery
\par
