\par
\textbf{For concreteness, let us refer to a stylized political application of this}
\par
\textbf{decision problem. An executive official must choose between several feas-}
\par
\textbf{ible policies. The official has some well-defined goals to accomplish}
\par
\textbf{through this choice but is not sure how well each policy would serve these}
