\par
to assess the indirect influence of published
\par
financial information (i.e. on union sources, press
\par
comment, etc.). Note that the potential usefulness
\par
of company accounts may be greater than its
\par
current use would suggest. Published accounts are
\par
rarely in a monopoly position with regard to
\par
information about a company yet their relative
\par
importance might well change if the data provided
