\par
As shown in Figure 1, the site is organized according to the user services
\par
described in the Executive Summary of the National ITS Architecture: Travel
\par
and Transportation Management, Public Transportation Operations, Electronic
\par
Payment, Commercial Vehicle Operations, Emergency Management, and
\par
Advanced Vehicle Control and Safety Systems. The site is intended for people
\par
with different objectives; thus information is provided on a variety of levels.
