\par
experience and drawing different fields together.
\par
This review is not meant to be exhaustive;
\par
rather, it is meant to illustrate how the Bayesian
\par
perspective can be used to illuminate a
\par
variety of tasks. As a result, it emphasizes
\par
new interpretations and, by reference to the
\par
