\par
The model has been generalized, to the case where there is no perfectly safe asset.
\par
The other assumptions appear, however, to be both crucial and unrealistic. In
\par
particular, one of the main implications of the model that all individuals' portfolios
\par
can be written as linear combinations of two mutual funds appears to be
\par
