We call a problem well-defined if there is a test which can be applied to a
\par
proposed solution. The difficulty is that these methods have no concept of
\par
partial success. It is obviously a great advantage in conducting a search to be
\par
able to know when one is close to a solution. The relation of certain action-
\par
