\par
contingent upon state s, but can purchase
\par
claims to (say) corn contingent upon state
\par
s. Under this Numeraire Contingent Mar-
\par
kets (NCM) regime, these purchases are
\par
in effect side-bets as to which state of the
\par
world is going to obtain, whose outcome
\par
will determine the individual's posterior
\par
wealth. After receipt of the message, of
\par
course, the individual will use his en-
\par
hanced or reduced wealth to purchase a
\par
preferred consumption basket in the
\par
posterior round of trading.
\par
Arrow [7, 1964] has shown that the same
\par
equilibrium allocation as indicated by con-
\par
ditions (2.8) under CCM (with prior trad-
\par
