\par
NCM with prior contingent trading only
\par
in the S claims to a single commodity. But
\par
given the prior-round incompleteness of
\par
this NCM regime, the availability of G
\par
markets in the posterior round becomes
\par
now quite essential. And once again, we
\par
must also specify the important proviso
\par
of "correct conditional price forecasting."
