\par
Third, and as noted earlier, it is important to recognize and specify the manifest and
\par
latent functions of F \& P (i.e., what the F \& P system is supposed to be doing and what
\par
it is doing). Furthermore, whereas both the inaccuracy of forecasts and the ambiguity
\par
of organizational goals must be accepted, one can and should be specific about the
