\par
(1970).
\par
154. \emph{Id. }at 44. Dean Calabresi suggests that occupational diseases and product-related dis-
\par
eases can be treated in the same way as accidents, in that they can be reduced in number and
\par
severity by the same methods, including methods aimed at primary cost reduction.
\par
