\par
of opportunistic redistribution (and the associated economic losses)
\par
engendered \textbf{by }such a rule. Thus, the discussion in this section \textbf{will }focus
\par
on the risks of opportunistic redistribution \textbf{(by }\emph{either }majority or minority)
