\par
amined more closely. It is suggested that three valuation objectives are
\par
possible when valuing the shares of minority shareholders: pre-transac-
\par
tion value based on market price, and hence, publicly available informa-
\par
tion; pre-transaction value based on inside information; and post-
\par
