\par
Systematic or market risk, on the other hand, is not diversifiable.
\par
This is because, in general, the securities of all companies will tend to be
\par
affected in the same \emph{direction }by general economic conditions. Even if an
\par
investor holds a large portfolio of securities, a change in market condi-
\par
