\par
the articles of incorporation may remove restrictions on the nature of the business the corporation
\par
may carry on, allowing it to engage in a business with a higher systematic risk than before. These
\par
changes may, of course, also alter the unsystematic risk of the enterprise.\textbf{\emph{CANADA-UNITED }}\emph{STATES LAW JOURNAL}
\par
