\textbf{\emph{D. }}\emph{Is the Appraisal Right an Efficient Protection Against Changes in}
\par
\emph{the Nature of the Business?}
\par
Thus far, I have focused on reasons why shareholders \emph{might }value
\par
the appraisal right as a protection against fundamental changes that
\par
either alter the risk of the business without altering security values or
\par
that adversely affect security values.58
