\par
both that the fundamental change will be approved \textbf{by }shareholders and that few if any shareholders
\par
will exercise dissent rights. Thus, it is even less likely in private corporations that value-increasing
\par
transactions will be deterred \textbf{by }the existence of an appraisal right.
