\par
respect of whether or not shareholder risk preferences will lead share-
\par
holders to prefer a contract with an appraisal right to one without. This
\par
is fundamentally an empirical matter and the answer may vary with dif-
\par
ferent types of corporations and different types of fundamental changes.
\par
This conclusion will form the basis for a suggested multiple option re-
\par
gime of statutory appraisal rights.
