\par
arrangement whereby the majority shareholders receive common shares
\par
in the reorganized enterprise but the minority receive cash, the majority
\par
and minority have clearly been treated in \emph{a formally }disparate manner.
\par
Nevertheless, as long as the \emph{economic value }of the consideration received
\par
by both majority and minority is essentially equivalent{$^\circ$}
\par
