\par
One of the greatest difficulties in designing an appraisal right arises
\par
in respect of the optimal form of valuation objective. If the appraisal
\par
right is to protect against redistribution, what is an event of redistribu-
\par
tion? It is clear that the term must be used with great care, for embedded
