\par
corporation
\par
Parent-subsidiary amalgamations or other going-private transac-
\par
tions where the parent is a private corporation present an intermediate
\par
case between pure going-private transactions and going-private transac-
\par
tions effected by public parent corporations. Like parent-subsidiary
\par
amalgamations where the parent is a public corporation, parent-subsidi-
\par
