\par
Rev. 65 (1985); Eisenberg, Private Ordering Through Negotiation: Dispute-Settlement \&
\par
Rulemaking, 89 Harv. L. Rev. 637 (1976); Lowenthal, A General Theory of Negotiation Pro-
\par
cess, Strategy and Behavior, 31 Kan. L. Rev. 69 (1982); Menkel-Meadow, Toward Another
\par
