Looking in more detail into the flexi-
\par
bility of energy use, we see the great
\par
potential for energy conservation. The
\par
improvement in energy efficiency is now
\par
at the core of energy policy-making.
\par
trend has been carefully, heavily,
\par
and extensively supported by analyses
\par
with energy demand models. I, for exam-
