ful aggregate evidence in support of the
\par
sometimes more anecdotal analyses of
\par
energy conservation enthusiasts. The
\par
models confirmed, as early as 19]4, what
\par
we all now believe: there is a tremen-
\par
dous potential for improving energy
\par
efficiency in the United States.
