\par
the needs of the energy supply system development. Let us therefore sub-
\par
divide the R+D programs into four classes with regard to the degree of their com-
\par
pletion and the time period expected to lead to the beginning of a large-scale
\par
deployment of the resulting energy technologies. Such a classification with
\par
indications of associated uncertainties of input data is given in Table 1.
