different combinations of physical, chemical, and effects; evaluation of the
\par
utmost levels of output characteristics of such technologies; assessment of their
\par
competitiveness with other classes of energy technologies; identification of the
\par
fundamental key problems. However, it should be noted here that, because of large
\par
uncertainties in the data used for super-long-range energy projections, a quantifi-
