ABSTRACT
\par
The paper reflects some methodical conceryts of the National nrogram
\par
for systems assessment of the long-term development of the Energy
\par
complex in Bulgaria. It contains brief notes on the decomposition of
\par
the general task of the management of development into subtasks ana de
\par
scribes the principles and state of the presently established system
\par
of models for assessing the long-term development.
