\par
into sub-tasks. Figure 1 represents in a generalized manner such a
\par
decomposition of the task of modeling NEC development in BUlgaria
\par
according to hierarchy levels of ES and management stages. The ener-
\par
systems in the country (general energy ano the electric energy,
\par
coal, oil and gas systems covered by it) are interryreted as three-
\par
level ones (national and regional levels and level of energv plants)
\par
whose development is solved at two main stages: planninq (Short-term
\par
annual, medium-term - at five year periods and long-term - every 15
\par
years) and long-term forecasting (15-40-50 years) .
\par
