\par
Economic Model
\par
The model is one of the key models of long-term forecasting. It aims
\par
at generating the basic indicators of the country's economic develop-
\par
- 197 -
\par
ment such as national income, production volume, investments and man-
\par
power according to sectors, necessary to determine energy demand and
\par
the development of the energy systems. It is also used to assess how
\par
the individual energy strategies affect the national income, the sec-
\par
toral distribution of production and manpower and the composition of
\par
foreign trade activities according to products.
\par
The building of such a model of the system of energy models in Bulga-
\par
ria is presently at the stage of study including the macro-model de-
\par
veloped in IIASA, the systems of models existing in Bulgaria and some
\par
other models developed in IIASA and other institutes.
\par
