\par
number of key sectors, incluoing energy, which could be used as con-
\par
straints of the development, However, the relationships in this sys-
\par
tem are not elements of an inout-out9ut model which hampers the clos-
\par
ing of the energy-economy 1000 for an assessment of energy strategies
\par
from the viewpoint of national economy,
