Further extention of modelling activities would be the use of multiple criteria
\par
decision making analysis and the use of an environmental sub-model containing emis-
\par
sions, environmental constraints and an environmental objective function.
\par
However, we did not yet estimate price elasticities of demand or linked the supply
\par
model to a demand model. These time-consuming activities will start in the near
\par
future.
