ENERGY MODEL FOR JAPAN IN A.D. 2025
\par
Committee on Energy System Analysis, JITA*
\par
F. Morl**, S. Wakamatsu***, T. Maeda**** and S. Yasui****
\par
{$\cdot$}Japan Industrial Technology Association, Tokyo, Japan
\par
