\par
which are necessary prerequisites for a rational discussion of various alterna-
\par
tives
\par
- ease of handl ing and quickness
\par
to allow a more rapid decision making after the decision relevant data and para-
\par
meters have changed
\par
- a high degree of flexibil ity
\par
to be able to change the model structure, and to incorporate different methods
\par
from subroutine I ibraries which are available
\par
- possibility of adjusting free parameters
\par
iteratively to meet given goals and constraints.
