\par
cally. If otherwise, however, they are not the same and A is more economical than
\par
B.
\par
2-3. Demand Projections-Objective Function
\par
- 331 -
\par
There are a couple of candidates of objective function. One is the total cost in-
\par
curred during planning horizon. That is,
\par
IT -pt
\par
