\par
While the good faith test substantially corresponds with the elements of
\par
scienter, the reasonable basis test clearly is distinct. The reasonable basis test
\par
imposes a duty on the forecaster to conduct a reasonable investigation. This
\par
duty assimilates a negligence-type standard that effectively creates a minimum
\par
criterion for establishing the initial misrepresentation stage for liability. The
