Unlike the good faith test, the characteristics of the reasonable basis test
\par
are distinct from those of the scienter element. The reasonable basis test and
\par
the element of scienter are compatible because they apply to different aspects
\par
of the antifraud cause of action. An opinion or projection implies a reasonable
\par
