One factor influencing the SEC's policy change on independent review was
\par
the creation of review procedures for forecasts by the American Institute of
\par
Certified Public Accountants (AICPA). 3 4 5 In fact, accountants had indirect
\par
experience with forward-looking data prior to this time. For instance, in the
\par
normal auditing process, accountants often review company internal budgets to
\par
aid in evaluating the reliability of the company's overall accounting system and
\par
in planning the auditing procedure.Y Accountants frequently deal with future-
\par
