\par
important element, followed by the accuracy/management reward factor and the
\par
amount of predicted change. 35{$^\circ$} However, reliance on past forecast accuracy as
\par
an indicator of future accuracy may present problems for public forecasts. Past
\par
accuracy should be viewed as only one factor, and should not be given excessive
\par
importance \textbf{.}
