\par
because the former includes facts that would not cause the market price to
\par
change if disclosed.' 8 9 Therefore, the market impact standard is included
\par
within the reasonable investor standard; satisfying the former would neces-
\par
sarily satisfy the latter.' 9 0 Evidence on the changing market price in connec-
