\par
to receiving any information. This basic model has been expanded in
\par
a variety of ways to encompass different substantive theories. The fol-
\par
lowing description will focus on an additive model as applied to a two-
\par
way factorial design. Here, the subject is shown a stimulus containing
\par
two descriptive items, one from the row dimension and one from the
\par
