6.3. Factory Monitoring
\par
As discussed in the section on simulation, the display facilities used to monitor the simulation are
\par
attached to the model. Hence, if the model is updated from real{$\cdot$}time messages from the factory floor, as
\par
opposed to the simulation, figures 4{$\cdot$}9,4{$\cdot$}10, and 5{$\cdot$}1 can be used to monitor the real{$\cdot$}time operation of an
\par
