\par
maintained by the system and available to him on request. To do this, !DAMS maintains three
\par
interrelated sets of data:
\par
{$\bullet$} Algorithms (the program library, e.g. APL, FORTRAN, PL! I, or Assembler procedures)
\par
{$\bullet$} Problem data (raw data as well as extraction data)
\par
