MANUFACTURING STRATEGY, ENVIRONMENTAL
\par
UNCERTAINTY AND PERFORMANCE:
\par
A PATH ANALYTIC MODEL*
\par
PAUL M. SWAMIDASS AND WILLIAM T. NEWELL
\par
Graduate School of Business, Indiana University,
