\par
Strategic Decision Making (process variable). The resulting model is shown in Figure 3.
\par
In this figure, the variable Environmental Uncertainty is labeled Perceived Environ-
\par
mental Uncertainty to recognize the fact that environmental uncertainty was assessed
\par
using perceptual measures in this study. Throughout this study, the terms perceived
\par
environmental uncertainty and environmental uncertainty are used interchangeably.
\par
The variable Manufacturing Flexibility in the model is a manufacturing strategy
\par
content variable helpful in coping with environmental uncertainty. The variable, the
\par
Role of Manufacturing Managers in Strategic Decision Making (RMMSDM), is an
